HBR-UNet

This distribution contains code derived from EGE-UNet:
https://github.com/JCruan519/EGE-UNet

The upstream EGE-UNet source is distributed under the Apache License 2.0.
A copy of that license is included in LICENSE.

The derivative implementation modifies the upstream model, configuration,
training loop, evaluation metrics, data loader, and loss implementation. The
principal additions are the high-level large-kernel (HLLK) block, decoder-stage
boundary-region refinement (BRR), auxiliary supervision, fixed-threshold
evaluation, HD95 calculation, early stopping, and safer image-mask validation.

